  "id": "BIT-couchdb-2026-90798",
  "summary": "Apache CouchDB: Replicator follows redirects indefinitely",
  "details": "A missing circuit-breaker in the replicator in Apache CouchDB 3.5.2 and below on all platforms allows the owner of a replication source or target to cause a denial of service via creating an infinite HTTP redirect loop.\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 3.5.3, which fixes this issue.",
